__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Applies to everyone who has set it up on their device. Anyone else uses their password or PIN as before.": "Geld vir almal wat dit op hul toestel opgestel het. Almal anders gebruik soos voorheen hul wagwoord of PIN.", "Ask for fingerprint or face before deleting or restoring records": "Vra vir vingerafdruk of gesig voor rekords geskrap of herstel word", "Ask for it when Pesa opens or after 5 minutes away": "Vra daarvoor wanneer Pesa oopmaak of na 5 minute weg", "Cancelled or not recognised. Try again, or use your password or PIN.": "Gekanselleer of nie herken nie. Probeer weer, of gebruik jou wagwoord of PIN.", "Confirm": "Bevestig", "Confirm with your password or PIN": "Bevestig met jou wagwoord of PIN", "Could not use fingerprint or face just now. Use your password or PIN.": "Kon nou nie vingerafdruk of gesig gebruik nie. Gebruik jou wagwoord of PIN.", "Fingerprint or face": "Vingerafdruk of gesig", "Fingerprint or face is already set up on this device.": "Vingerafdruk of gesig is reeds op hierdie toestel opgestel.", "Fingerprint or face is set up": "Vingerafdruk of gesig is opgestel", "Fingerprint or face is set up on this device.": "Vingerafdruk of gesig is op hierdie toestel opgestel.", "Fingerprint or face unlock does not work from this web address. Open Pesa from its own website or the installed app.": "Vingerafdruk- of gesigontsluiting werk nie vanaf hierdie webadres nie. Maak Pesa oop vanaf sy eie webwerf of die geïnstalleerde toepassing.", "Fingerprint or face unlock is not available here. It needs Windows Hello, Touch ID, Face ID or a fingerprint reader on this computer or device, and Pesa opened from its own website or the installed app.": "Vingerafdruk- of gesigontsluiting is nie hier beskikbaar nie. Dit het Windows Hello, Touch ID, Face ID of 'n vingerafdruklesers op hierdie rekenaar of toestel nodig, en Pesa moet vanaf sy eie webwerf of die geïnstalleerde toepassing oopgemaak word.", "Not verified": "Nie geverifieer nie", "Pesa is locked": "Pesa is gesluit", "Remove from this device": "Verwyder van hierdie toestel", "Removed from this device": "Van hierdie toestel verwyder", "Set up fingerprint or face on this device": "Stel vingerafdruk of gesig op hierdie toestel op", "Test it": "Toets dit", "Unlock with fingerprint or face": "Ontsluit met vingerafdruk of gesig", "Use password or PIN instead": "Gebruik eerder wagwoord of PIN", "Use the fingerprint or face unlock of this computer or device to sign in and to approve important actions. Pesa never sees or stores your fingerprint or face.": "Gebruik die vingerafdruk- of gesigontsluiting van hierdie rekenaar of toestel om aan te meld en belangrike dade goed te keur. Pesa sien of stoor nooit jou vingerafdruk of gesig nie.", "Verified. It works.": "Geverifieer. Dit werk.", "Use fingerprint or face": "Gebruik vingerafdruk of gesig", "or use your PIN": "of gebruik jou PIN", "or use your password": "of gebruik jou wagwoord", "Fingerprint or face unlock": "Vingerafdruk- of gesigontsluiting", "Sign in quickly and approve important actions with the unlock your computer or device already has.": "Meld vinnig aan en keur belangrike dade goed met die ontsluiting wat jou rekenaar of toestel reeds het.", "Settings → Account → Fingerprint or face": "Instellings → Rekening → Vingerafdruk of gesig", "Open Settings and find Fingerprint or face under Account.": "Maak Instellings oop en vind Vingerafdruk of gesig onder Rekening.", "Tap Set up fingerprint or face on this device and follow the prompt from Windows Hello, Touch ID, Face ID or your Android fingerprint.": "Tik Stel vingerafdruk of gesig op hierdie toestel op en volg die aanwyser van Windows Hello, Touch ID, Face ID of jou Android-vingerafdruk.", "On the sign in screen, tap your name and tap Use fingerprint or face. Your password or PIN still works.": "Tik op die aanmeldskerm op jou naam en tik Gebruik vingerafdruk of gesig. Jou wagwoord of PIN werk steeds.", "Tick Ask for it when Pesa opens or after 5 minutes away to lock Pesa when nobody is using it.": "Merk Vra daarvoor wanneer Pesa oopmaak of na 5 minute weg om Pesa te sluit wanneer niemand dit gebruik nie.", "Owners can tick Ask for fingerprint or face before deleting or restoring records, to protect important data.": "Eienaars kan Vra vir vingerafdruk of gesig voor rekords geskrap of herstel word merk om belangrike data te beskerm.", "Set it up on each computer or device you use. If several people share one computer login, the computer cannot tell them apart, so use it on your own computer or device.": "Stel dit op elke rekenaar of toestel op wat jy gebruik. As verskeie mense een rekenaar-aanmelding deel, kan die rekenaar hulle nie uitmekaar ken nie, so gebruik dit op jou eie rekenaar of toestel.", "Fingerprint and face unlock use the lock of your own computer or device, such as Windows Hello, Touch ID, Face ID or an Android fingerprint. Pesa never sees, stores or sends your fingerprint or face. The device only tells Pesa yes or no": "Vingerafdruk- en gesigontsluiting gebruik die slot van jou eie rekenaar of toestel, soos Windows Hello, Touch ID, Face ID of 'n Android-vingerafdruk. Pesa sien, stoor of stuur nooit jou vingerafdruk of gesig nie. Die toestel sê net vir Pesa ja of nee", "Fingerprint or face unlock: set it up per computer or device in Settings, sign in with it, lock Pesa when you are away, and let owners require it before deleting or restoring records. Pesa never sees your fingerprint or face": "Vingerafdruk- of gesigontsluiting: stel dit per rekenaar of toestel in Instellings op, meld daarmee aan, sluit Pesa wanneer jy weg is, en laat eienaars dit vereis voor rekords geskrap of herstel word. Pesa sien nooit jou vingerafdruk of gesig nie"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"That password is too easy to guess. Choose a different one.": "Daardie wagwoord is te maklik om te raai. Kies ’n ander een.", "Choose a password of at least 8 characters.": "Kies ’n wagwoord van minstens 8 karakters.", "Signed out because Pesa was not used for a while.": "Afgemeld omdat Pesa ’n rukkie nie gebruik is nie.", "Security check": "Sekuriteitskontrole", "Secure connection": "Veilige verbinding", "Pesa is open on a secure address (HTTPS). Information moving to your cloud project is encrypted on the way.": "Pesa is op ’n veilige adres (HTTPS) oop. Inligting wat na jou wolkprojek beweeg, word onderweg geënkripteer.", "This address is not secure. Open Pesa from its https website or the installed app.": "Hierdie adres is nie veilig nie. Maak Pesa oop vanaf sy https-webwerf of die geïnstalleerde toepassing.", "Guessing is limited": "Raai is beperk", "After 3 wrong passwords or PINs, signing in locks for 1 minute, then 5, then 15. Every lock is written to the Activity log.": "Ná 3 verkeerde wagwoorde of PIN’s sluit aanmelding vir 1 minuut, dan 5, dan 15. Elke sluiting word in die Aktiwiteitslogboek geskryf.", "lock(s) in the last 30 days. Check the Activity log.": "sluiting(s) in die laaste 30 dae. Kyk in die Aktiwiteitslogboek.", "Strong passwords": "Sterk wagwoorde", "New passwords need at least 8 characters and cannot be a common password. Cashiers use a 4 digit PIN, so keep them on a device you trust.": "Nuwe wagwoorde moet minstens 8 karakters wees en mag nie ’n algemene wagwoord wees nie. Kassiers gebruik ’n 4-syfer-PIN, hou hulle dus op ’n toestel wat jy vertrou.", "Automatic sign out": "Outomatiese afmelding", "Pesa signs people out after": "Pesa meld mense af ná", "minutes without use.": "minute sonder gebruik.", "Off. Turn it on so a computer left open does not stay signed in.": "Af. Skakel dit aan sodat ’n rekenaar wat oop gelaat is nie aangemeld bly nie.", "After": "Na", "minutes": "minute", "Off": "Af", "Set up on this device.": "Op hierdie toestel opgestel.", "Not set up on this device. Add it under Settings → Account.": "Nie op hierdie toestel opgestel nie. Voeg dit by onder Instellings → Rekening.", "Approval before deleting": "Goedkeuring voor skrap", "On. Deleting or restoring records asks for fingerprint or face, or the password.": "Aan. Skrap of herstel van rekords vra vir vingerafdruk of gesig, of die wagwoord.", "Off. Turn it on under Settings → Account.": "Af. Skakel dit aan onder Instellings → Rekening.", "Cloud sync": "Wolksinkronisering", "On. Use your own cloud project, keep its sync code private, and turn on its access rules (Row Level Security) so only your business can read the data.": "Aan. Gebruik jou eie wolkprojek, hou sy sinkkode privaat, en skakel sy toegangsreëls (Row Level Security) aan sodat net jou besigheid die data kan lees.", "Off. Your records stay on this device.": "Af. Jou rekords bly op hierdie toestel.", "Backups": "Rugsteun", "A backup was made in the last week.": "’n Rugsteun is in die laaste week gemaak.", "No recent backup. Make one from Settings so a lost or damaged device does not lose your records.": "Geen onlangse rugsteun nie. Maak een vanaf Instellings sodat ’n verlore of beskadigde toestel nie jou rekords laat verlore gaan nie.", "About a firewall": "Oor ’n brandmuur", "A firewall protects a server. Your Pesa website is only files, so for a firewall and protection against floods of traffic, put the website behind a free service such as Cloudflare. Ask the person who looks after your website to set it up.": "’n Brandmuur beskerm ’n bediener. Jou Pesa-webwerf is net lêers, so sit die webwerf agter ’n gratis diens soos Cloudflare vir ’n brandmuur en beskerming teen vloede van verkeer. Vra die persoon wat jou webwerf versorg om dit op te stel.", "Open Activity log": "Maak Aktiwiteitslogboek oop", "Pesa runs on your own computers and devices, so there is no server of ours to put a firewall on. These are the protections that apply to your business and what you can still do.": "Pesa loop op jou eie rekenaars en toestelle, so daar is geen bediener van ons om ’n brandmuur op te sit nie. Dit is die beskermings wat op jou besigheid van toepassing is en wat jy nog kan doen.", "Security: wrong password limits at sign in, stronger password rules (8 characters), automatic sign out, failed sign ins in the Activity log, a browser security policy, and a Security check for owners": "Sekuriteit: perke op verkeerde wagwoorde by aanmelding, sterker wagwoordreëls (8 karakters), outomatiese afmelding, mislukte aanmeldings in die Aktiwiteitslogboek, ’n blaaier-sekuriteitsbeleid, en ’n Sekuriteitskontrole vir eienaars", "See how your business is protected and switch on automatic sign out.": "Kyk hoe jou besigheid beskerm word en skakel outomatiese afmelding aan.", "Menu → Security check (Owner)": "Kieslys → Sekuriteitskontrole (Eienaar)", "Open the menu and tap Security check.": "Maak die kieslys oop en tik Sekuriteitskontrole.", "Read each line. A green tick means it is protected, an exclamation mark means there is something to do.": "Lees elke reël. ’n Groen regmerkie beteken dit is beskerm, ’n uitroepteken beteken daar is iets om te doen.", "Under Automatic sign out choose how long Pesa waits before it signs people out.": "Kies onder Outomatiese afmelding hoe lank Pesa wag voor dit mense afmeld.", "If sign in locks after wrong tries, look in the Activity log to see who was trying.": "As aanmelding ná verkeerde pogings sluit, kyk in die Aktiwiteitslogboek om te sien wie probeer het.", "Make a backup from Settings now and then.": "Maak nou en dan ’n rugsteun vanaf Instellings.", "Passwords need at least 8 characters. Cashiers use a 4 digit PIN, so only let them use Pesa on devices you trust.": "Wagwoorde moet minstens 8 karakters wees. Kassiers gebruik ’n 4-syfer-PIN, laat hulle dus net Pesa op toestelle gebruik wat jy vertrou.", "After three wrong tries at signing in, the sign in locks for a while, and every lock is written to the Activity log so the owner can see it": "Ná drie verkeerde pogings by aanmelding sluit die aanmelding vir ’n rukkie, en elke sluiting word in die Aktiwiteitslogboek geskryf sodat die eienaar dit kan sien"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Browser and computer": "Blaaier en rekenaar", "cores": "kerne", "Saving your records": "Stoor van jou rekords", "Records are saved safely in this browser.": "Rekords word veilig in hierdie blaaier gestoor.", "Records are saved in a smaller space in this browser. Fine for a small shop.": "Rekords word in ’n kleiner spasie in hierdie blaaier gestoor. Goed vir ’n klein winkel.", "This browser blocks saving. Turn off private browsing, or allow site data for Pesa.": "Hierdie blaaier blokkeer stoor. Skakel private blaai af, of laat werfdata vir Pesa toe.", "Secure address": "Veilige adres", "Secure (https). Everything is available.": "Veilig (https). Alles is beskikbaar.", "Not a secure address. Pesa still works, using its built in security code, but installing the app, fingerprint and face unlock are not available.": "Nie ’n veilige adres nie. Pesa werk steeds, met sy ingeboude sekuriteitskode, maar installering van die toepassing, vingerafdruk- en gesigontsluiting is nie beskikbaar nie.", "Screen size": "Skermgrootte", "Full layout with the side menu.": "Volle uitleg met die kantkieslys.", "Compact layout. Open the menu with the button at the top left.": "Kompakte uitleg. Maak die kieslys oop met die knoppie links bo.", "Works without internet": "Werk sonder internet", "Installed as an app. It opens without internet.": "As ’n toepassing geïnstalleer. Dit maak sonder internet oop.", "This browser can keep Pesa for offline use. Use Install under Help.": "Hierdie blaaier kan Pesa vir vanlyn gebruik hou. Gebruik Installeer onder Hulp.", "Offline use needs a secure address. Open Pesa from its https website.": "Vanlyn gebruik het ’n veilige adres nodig. Maak Pesa oop vanaf sy https-webwerf.", "Invoices, receipts and reports (PDF)": "Fakture, kwitansies en verslae (PDF)", "Ready.": "Gereed.", "Loads the first time you make a document. This needs internet once, then it is kept.": "Laai die eerste keer wat jy ’n dokument maak. Dit het eenmalig internet nodig, daarna word dit behou.", "Barcode scanning with the camera": "Strepieskode-skandering met die kamera", "Camera found, but this browser cannot read barcodes. A USB scanner works on every computer.": "Kamera gevind, maar hierdie blaaier kan nie strepieskodes lees nie. ’n USB-skandeerder werk op elke rekenaar.", "No camera access here. A USB barcode scanner works on every computer.": "Geen kameratoegang hier nie. ’n USB-strepieskodeskandeerder werk op elke rekenaar.", "Receipt printer and till drawer (Bluetooth)": "Kwitansiedrukker en kassalaai (Bluetooth)", "Ready, in Chrome or Edge.": "Gereed, in Chrome of Edge.", "Not in this browser. Use Chrome or Edge for the till drawer. Printing receipts to any printer still works.": "Nie in hierdie blaaier nie. Gebruik Chrome of Edge vir die kassalaai. Kwitansies na enige drukker druk werk steeds.", "Nearby Wi-Fi sync": "Nabye Wi-Fi-sinkronisering", "Not in this browser. Use cloud sync instead.": "Nie in hierdie blaaier nie. Gebruik eerder wolksinkronisering.", "Look and speed": "Voorkoms en spoed", "Simpler look is on, for speed.": "Eenvoudiger voorkoms is aan, vir spoed.", "Full look. If Pesa feels slow, turn on the simpler look in Settings.": "Volle voorkoms. As Pesa stadig voel, skakel die eenvoudiger voorkoms in Instellings aan.", "Check this computer": "Kontroleer hierdie rekenaar", "Pesa works on Windows, Mac, Chromebook, Linux, Android and iPhone or iPad, using Chrome, Edge, Firefox or Safari from about 2020 onward. This shows what this computer can do. A tick means ready, an info mark means it works without that feature.": "Pesa werk op Windows, Mac, Chromebook, Linux, Android en iPhone of iPad, met Chrome, Edge, Firefox of Safari van ongeveer 2020 af. Dit wys wat hierdie rekenaar kan doen. ’n Regmerkie beteken gereed, ’n inligtingteken beteken dit werk sonder daardie kenmerk.", "Copy this report": "Kopieer hierdie verslag", "Report copied": "Verslag gekopieer", "Simpler look for older or slower computers": "Eenvoudiger voorkoms vir ouer of stadiger rekenaars", "Turns off blur and animations so Pesa runs faster on older computers.": "Skakel vervaging en animasies af sodat Pesa vinniger op ouer rekenaars loop.", "Works on all kinds of computers: a clear message instead of a blank page on browsers that are too old, sign in that works on plain http addresses, a simpler look for slow computers, and a Check this computer screen": "Werk op alle soorte rekenaars: ’n duidelike boodskap in plaas van ’n leë bladsy op blaaiers wat te oud is, aanmelding wat op gewone http-adresse werk, ’n eenvoudiger voorkoms vir stadige rekenaars, en ’n Kontroleer hierdie rekenaar-skerm", "Check that Pesa suits this computer and make it faster.": "Kontroleer dat Pesa by hierdie rekenaar pas en maak dit vinniger.", "Menu → Check this computer": "Kieslys → Kontroleer hierdie rekenaar", "Open the menu and tap Check this computer.": "Maak die kieslys oop en tik Kontroleer hierdie rekenaar.", "Read the list. A tick means that part is ready. An info mark means Pesa works without it.": "Lees die lys. ’n Regmerkie beteken daardie deel is gereed. ’n Inligtingteken beteken Pesa werk daarsonder.", "If Pesa feels slow, open Settings and tick Simpler look for older or slower computers.": "As Pesa stadig voel, maak Instellings oop en merk Eenvoudiger voorkoms vir ouer of stadiger rekenaars.", "If you see a message that the browser is too old, open Pesa in the latest Chrome, Edge or Firefox.": "As jy ’n boodskap sien dat die blaaier te oud is, maak Pesa oop in die nuutste Chrome, Edge of Firefox.", "On Windows 7 or 8, use Chrome version 109.": "Gebruik op Windows 7 of 8 Chrome-weergawe 109.", "A USB barcode scanner and any printer work on every computer, even where the camera or Bluetooth do not.": "’n USB-strepieskodeskandeerder en enige drukker werk op elke rekenaar, selfs waar die kamera of Bluetooth nie werk nie."}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"My voice": "My stem", "Record each training slide in your own voice. Your recording plays instead of the computer or device voice. Any slide you have not recorded keeps the computer voice.": "Neem elke opleidingskyfie in jou eie stem op. Jou opname speel in plaas van die rekenaar of toestel se stem. Enige kyfie wat jy nie opgeneem het nie, hou die rekenaarstem.", "Recording language": "Opnametaal", "of": "van", "slides recorded": "kyfies opgeneem", "Recorded": "Opgeneem", "Welcome greeting": "Welkomsgroet", "Said when Pesa opens": "Gesê wanneer Pesa oopmaak", "recorded": "opgeneem", "Save my voice pack": "Stoor my stempakket", "Load a voice pack": "Laai ’n stempakket", "Delete my recordings": "Skrap my opnames", "Recordings are kept on this computer or device. To use them on other computers or devices, save a voice pack and load it there.": "Opnames word op hierdie rekenaar of toestel gehou. Om dit op ander rekenaars of toestelle te gebruik, stoor ’n stempakket en laai dit daar.", "Nothing recorded yet": "Nog niks opgeneem nie", "Voice pack saved": "Stempakket gestoor", "Could not save the voice pack": "Kon nie die stempakket stoor nie", "recordings loaded": "opnames gelaai", "That is not a Pesa voice pack": "Dit is nie ’n Pesa-stempakket nie", "This deletes every voice recording on this computer or device. The computer voice will be used again.": "Dit skrap elke stemopname op hierdie rekenaar of toestel. Die rekenaarstem sal weer gebruik word.", "Delete": "Skrap", "Recordings deleted": "Opnames geskrap", "Text changed since you recorded": "Teks het verander sedert jy opgeneem het", "Not recorded yet": "Nog nie opgeneem nie", "Tap a slide to record it. Read the words on the screen in your own way. You do not need to say them word for word.": "Tik op ’n kyfie om dit op te neem. Lees die woorde op die skerm op jou eie manier. Jy hoef dit nie woord vir woord te sê nie.", "Delete this recording": "Skrap hierdie opname", "The computer voice will read this slide again.": "Die rekenaarstem sal hierdie kyfie weer lees.", "Recording deleted": "Opname geskrap", "Read this out loud": "Lees dit hardop", "Start recording": "Begin opneem", "This browser cannot record. Record on your computer or device with its voice recorder app, then add the file here.": "Hierdie blaaier kan nie opneem nie. Neem op jou rekenaar of toestel met sy stemopnemer-toep op en voeg dan die lêer hier by.", "Add an audio file instead": "Voeg eerder ’n klanklêer by", "That file is too big. Keep each slide under 25 MB.": "Daardie lêer is te groot. Hou elke kyfie onder 25 MB.", "Pesa could not read that audio file.": "Pesa kon nie daardie klanklêer lees nie.", "Stop": "Stop", "Listen": "Luister", "Save and record next slide": "Stoor en neem volgende kyfie op", "Record again": "Neem weer op", "Saved": "Gestoor", "Could not save the recording": "Kon nie die opname stoor nie", "Could not start recording.": "Kon nie opneem begin nie.", "That was too short. Try again.": "Dit was te kort. Probeer weer.", "Pesa is not allowed to use the microphone. Allow the microphone for this site in the browser, then try again.": "Pesa mag nie die mikrofoon gebruik nie. Laat die mikrofoon vir hierdie werf in die blaaier toe en probeer dan weer.", "Could not start the microphone. Check that one is connected.": "Kon nie die mikrofoon begin nie. Kyk of een gekoppel is.", "Record my voice": "Neem my stem op"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Record hands free": "Neem handevry op", "Press Start, then read each slide out loud one after the other. When you stop talking for a moment, Pesa saves that slide and shows the next one. You do not need to touch the screen between slides.": "Druk Begin en lees dan elke kyfie hardop, een na die ander. Wanneer jy vir ’n oomblik ophou praat, stoor Pesa daardie kyfie en wys die volgende een. Jy hoef nie tussen kyfies aan die skerm te raak nie.", "Pause that ends a slide": "Pouse wat ’n kyfie beëindig", "Short": "Kort", "Normal": "Normaal", "Long": "Lank", "seconds": "sekondes", "Record again the slides I already have": "Neem die kyfies wat ek reeds het weer op", "Start": "Begin", "Find a quiet place. Pause for about 3 seconds after each slide. Pauses inside a slide, like between sentences, are fine.": "Kry ’n stil plek. Wag ongeveer 3 sekondes na elke kyfie. Pouses binne ’n kyfie, soos tussen sinne, is reg.", "slides to record": "kyfies om op te neem", "about": "omtrent", "minutes": "minute", "already recorded and skipped": "reeds opgeneem en oorgeslaan", "Nothing to record": "Niks om op te neem nie", "Slide": "Kyfie", "Redo last slide": "Herdoen laaste kyfie", "Skip this slide": "Slaan hierdie kyfie oor", "Stop recording": "Hou op opneem", "Read this slide again": "Lees hierdie kyfie weer", "Stopped": "Gestop", "All done": "Alles klaar", "slides saved in your voice.": "kyfies in jou stem gestoor.", "Done": "Klaar", "Waiting for you to start reading": "Wag vir jou om te begin lees", "Listening": "Luister", "Getting ready": "Maak gereed", "now the next slide": "nou die volgende kyfie", "Read the slides one after another and Pesa saves each one by itself. Or tap a lesson below to record slide by slide.": "Lees die kyfies een na die ander en Pesa stoor elkeen self. Of tik hieronder op ’n les om kyfie vir kyfie op te neem.", "Record this whole lesson hands free": "Neem hierdie hele les handevry op"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Invoice details": "Fakturabesonderhede", "Issue date": "Uitreikdatum", "Due date": "Vervaldatum", "Invoice no.": "Faktuurnr.", "Notes": "Notas", "Quote no.": "Kwotasienr.", "Prepared for": "Opgestel vir", "Quotation details": "Kwotasiebesonderhede", "Terms & conditions": "Bepalings en voorwaardes", "Acceptance": "Aanvaarding", "Authorised for the business": "Gemagtig vir die besigheid", "Accepted by customer": "Aanvaar deur kliënt", "Signature": "Handtekening", "Paid": "Betaal", "Report details": "Verslagbesonderhede", "Business": "Besigheid", "Report": "Verslag", "Credit and stock": "Krediet en voorraad", "Item": "Item", "Value": "Waarde", "Measure": "Maatstaf", "Job title": "Pos titel", "Employee no.": "Werknemernr.", "Business report": "Besigheidsverslag", "Quotation total": "Kwotasie totaal", "CONTINUED": "VERVOLG", "Wastage": "Vermorsing", "Totals": "Totale", "Note": "Nota", "Quotation": "Kwotasie", "VAT no.": "BTW nr.", "Unit price": "Eenheidsprys", "Description": "Beskrywing", "Stock value": "Voorraadwaarde", "Qty sold": "Hoeveelheid verkoop", "Revenue": "Inkomste", "Summary details": "Opsommingsbesonderhede", "VAT rate": "BTW koers", "Monthly work report": "Maandelikse werkverslag", "by": "deur", "Total due": "Totaal verskuldig"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Activate key": "Aktiveer sleutel", "Ask the owner to renew.": "Vra die eienaar om te hernu.", "Copy reference": "Kopieer verwysing", "Could not check the key on this device.": "Kon nie die sleutel op hierdie toestel nagaan nie.", "Documents version": "Dokumenteweergawe", "Download a backup of my data": "Laai ’n rugsteun van my data af", "Email support": "E-pos ondersteuning", "Email us instead": "Stuur eerder vir ons ’n e-pos", "Ended": "Verstreke", "Ended, short grace period": "Verstreke, kort genadetydperk", "Free trial": "Gratis proeftydperk", "Free trial: {0} days left.": "Gratis proeftydperk: {0} dae oor.", "I have a licence key": "Ek het ’n lisensiesleutel", "I have read and agree to the Pesa confidentiality and privacy agreement and the Terms of Service.": "Ek het die Pesa-vertroulikheids- en privaatheidsooreenkoms en die Diensbepalings gelees en stem saam.", "Licence activated. Thank you!": "Lisensie geaktiveer. Dankie!", "Licence and subscription": "Lisensie en intekening", "Licence key": "Lisensiesleutel", "Licence reference": "Lisensieverwysing", "Message support on WhatsApp": "Stuur ondersteuning ’n WhatsApp", "Only the owner can activate a key.": "Net die eienaar kan ’n sleutel aktiveer.", "Open the menu and tap Licence and subscription.": "Maak die kieslys oop en tik op Lisensie en intekening.", "Paste your licence key first.": "Plak eers jou lisensiesleutel.", "Plan": "Plan", "Plans": "Planne", "Please ask the owner of the business to renew the subscription.": "Vra asseblief die eienaar van die besigheid om die intekening te hernu.", "Read the Terms of Service": "Lees die Diensbepalings", "Reference copied": "Verwysing gekopieer", "Renew on WhatsApp": "Hernu op WhatsApp", "Send this when you subscribe or renew.": "Stuur dit wanneer jy inteken of hernu.", "Subscribe on WhatsApp": "Teken in op WhatsApp", "Terms of Service": "Diensbepalings", "Terms, privacy and support": "Bepalings, privaatheid en ondersteuning", "That does not look like a Pesa licence key. Copy the whole key, starting with PESA1.": "Dit lyk nie soos ’n Pesa-lisensiesleutel nie. Kopieer die hele sleutel, wat met PESA1 begin.", "That key is damaged. Copy it again, completely.": "Daardie sleutel is beskadig. Kopieer dit weer, heeltemal.", "This device cannot check licence keys. Open Pesa from its web address (https) and try again.": "Hierdie toestel kan nie lisensiesleutels nagaan nie. Maak Pesa oop vanaf sy webadres (https) en probeer weer.", "This key is not valid for this version of Pesa.": "Hierdie sleutel is nie geldig vir hierdie weergawe van Pesa nie.", "This key is not valid. Check that it was copied completely.": "Hierdie sleutel is nie geldig nie. Kyk of dit heeltemal gekopieer is.", "This key was issued for a different business. Send your Licence reference to get the right one.": "Hierdie sleutel is vir ’n ander besigheid uitgereik. Stuur jou Lisensieverwysing om die regte een te kry.", "Trial ends": "Proeftydperk eindig", "Unlimited staff accounts": "Onbeperkte personeelrekeninge", "Up to {0} staff accounts": "Tot {0} personeelrekeninge", "You already have a key that lasts longer than this one.": "Jy het reeds ’n sleutel wat langer duur as hierdie een.", "Your free trial has ended": "Jou gratis proeftydperk het geëindig", "Your records are safe and nothing has been deleted. Subscribe to carry on selling with Pesa.": "Jou rekords is veilig en niks is uitgevee nie. Teken in om voort te gaan verkoop met Pesa.", "Your subscription ended. Pesa locks in {0} days unless you renew.": "Jou intekening het verstryk. Pesa sluit oor {0} dae tensy jy hernu.", "Your subscription ends in {0} days.": "Jou intekening eindig oor {0} dae.", "Your subscription has ended": "Jou intekening het verstryk", "Your {0} plan allows up to {1} {2}. Upgrade to add more.": "Jou {0}-plan laat tot {1} {2} toe. Gradeer op om meer by te voeg.", "branches": "takke", "days left": "dae oor", "staff accounts": "personeelrekeninge", "unlimited branches": "onbeperkte takke", "up to {0} branches": "tot {0} takke", "The sync code must be at least 16 letters or digits. Tap Generate code.": "Die sinkroniseerkode moet minstens 16 letters of syfers wees. Tik op Genereer kode."}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Download as": "Laai af as", "File format": "Lêerformaat", "PDF document": "PDF-dokument", "Word document": "Word-dokument", "Excel spreadsheet": "Excel-sigblad", "CSV (comma separated)": "CSV (kommageskei)", "Web page": "Webblad", "Rich text": "Ryke teks", "Plain text": "Gewone teks", "Picture (PNG)": "Prent (PNG)", "Picture (JPG)": "Prent (JPG)", "Looks the same everywhere. Best for sending and printing.": "Lyk oral dieselfde. Die beste keuse om te stuur en te druk.", "Opens in Microsoft Word, Google Docs and LibreOffice, so you can edit it.": "Maak oop in Microsoft Word, Google Docs en LibreOffice, sodat jy dit kan wysig.", "Opens in Excel and Google Sheets. Amounts are real numbers you can add up.": "Maak oop in Excel en Google Sheets. Bedrae is regte syfers wat jy kan optel.", "Plain table data for Excel, accounting programs and imports.": "Gewone tabeldata vir Excel, rekeningkundige programme en invoer.", "Opens in any browser and can be printed from there.": "Maak oop in enige blaaier en kan daarvandaan gedruk word.", "Opens in WordPad, TextEdit, Word and most editors.": "Maak oop in WordPad, TextEdit, Word en die meeste redigeerders.", "Words and numbers only. Works anywhere.": "Net woorde en syfers. Werk oral.", "A sharp picture of the document, handy for WhatsApp.": "’n Skerp prent van die dokument, handig vir WhatsApp.", "A smaller picture of the document.": "’n Kleiner prent van die dokument.", "Created with Pesa": "Geskep met Pesa", "Couldn’t make that format. Try PDF instead.": "Kon nie daardie formaat maak nie. Probeer eerder PDF.", "Download full report": "Laai volledige verslag af", "Download report": "Laai verslag af", "Download invoice": "Laai faktuur af", "Make labels": "Maak etikette"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Tax records (NamRA)": "Belastingrekords (NamRA)", "NamRA has not published its e-invoicing rules yet. Turn this on to keep a numbered, tamper-evident tax record of every sale on this device, ready for when it does. Nothing is sent to NamRA until you enter an address and key below. Selling never waits for tax or the internet.": "NamRA het nog nie sy e-faktuurreëls gepubliseer nie. Skakel dit aan om van elke verkoping op hierdie toestel ’n genommerde, peuterbestande belastingrekord te hou, gereed vir wanneer dit gebeur. Niks word na NamRA gestuur voordat jy hieronder ’n adres en sleutel invoer nie. Verkope wag nooit vir belasting of die internet nie.", "Set a VAT rate above 0 first (Reports, VAT summary). Tax records need it.": "Stel eers ’n BTW-koers bo 0 (Verslae, BTW-opsomming). Belastingrekords het dit nodig.", "Keep tax records on this device": "Hou belastingrekords op hierdie toestel", "Your business": "Jou besigheid", "Tax number (TIN)": "Belastingnommer (TIN)", "Branch code": "Takkode", "This device": "Hierdie toestel", "Terminal ID": "Terminaal-ID", "Locked: this device already has tax records. Use a different Terminal ID on every other device.": "Gesluit: hierdie toestel het reeds belastingrekords. Gebruik ’n ander Terminaal-ID op elke ander toestel.", "Use a different Terminal ID on every computer or device. It cannot be changed after the first sale.": "Gebruik ’n ander Terminaal-ID op elke rekenaar of toestel. Dit kan nie na die eerste verkoping verander word nie.", "NamRA address (https)": "NamRA-adres (https)", "optional": "opsioneel", "Access key": "Toegangsleutel", "The address and key stay on this device only.": "Die adres en sleutel bly net op hierdie toestel.", "Waiting to send": "Wag om te stuur", "Cleared": "Goedgekeur", "Needs attention": "Het aandag nodig", "Not recording yet. Fill in every field above, turn it on and save.": "Teken nog nie op nie. Vul elke veld hierbo in, skakel dit aan en stoor.", "Recording tax records on this device. Nothing is sent: no address and key yet.": "Belastingrekords word op hierdie toestel opgeteken. Niks word gestuur nie: nog geen adres en sleutel.", "Sending is stopped because the address or key was refused. Check them, then tap Resume.": "Stuur is gestop omdat die adres of sleutel geweier is. Kontroleer hulle en tik dan op Hervat.", "Offline. Records are safe and will send when you are back online.": "Aflyn. Rekords is veilig en sal gestuur word wanneer jy weer aanlyn is.", "Sending in the background.": "Stuur op die agtergrond.", "Send now": "Stuur nou", "Retry failed": "Probeer misluktes weer", "Resume": "Hervat", "Enter your tax number (TIN): letters, numbers and dashes, 4 to 20 characters.": "Voer jou belastingnommer (TIN) in: letters, syfers en strepies, 4 tot 20 karakters.", "Enter a branch code: letters, numbers and dashes, up to 16 characters.": "Voer ’n takkode in: letters, syfers en strepies, tot 16 karakters.", "Enter a Terminal ID for this device: letters, numbers and dashes, up to 16 characters.": "Voer ’n Terminaal-ID vir hierdie toestel in: letters, syfers en strepies, tot 16 karakters.", "The address must start with https://": "Die adres moet met https:// begin", "Sale saved. Its tax record needs attention: open Settings, Tax records.": "Verkoping gestoor. Die belastingrekord het aandag nodig: maak Instellings, Belastingrekords oop.", "Keep a numbered, tamper-evident tax record of every sale, ready for NamRA e-invoicing when it starts.": "Hou ’n genommerde, peuterbestande belastingrekord van elke verkoping, gereed vir NamRA-e-fakturering wanneer dit begin.", "Set up tax records": "Stel belastingrekords op", "Tax category": "Belastingkategorie", "Standard rate": "Standaardkoers", "Zero rated (0%)": "Nulkoers (0%)", "Exempt": "Vrygestel"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Tap to skip": "Tik om oor te slaan", "Show the opening animation when Pesa starts": "Wys die openingsanimasie wanneer Pesa begin", "Watch the opening animation": "Kyk na die openingsanimasie"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Legal name on your BIPA certificate": "Wetlike naam op jou BIPA-sertifikaat", "The number has the usual BIPA shape.": "Die nommer het die gewone BIPA-vorm.", "This does not look like the usual format (for example CC/2024/00123). You can still save it if it is correct.": "Dit lyk nie soos die gewone formaat nie (byvoorbeeld CC/2024/00123). Jy kan dit steeds stoor as dit korrek is.", "Verified with BIPA": "Met BIPA bevestig", "Entered by you, not checked with BIPA": "Deur jou ingevoer, nie met BIPA nagegaan nie", "Look it up on the BIPA website": "Soek dit op die BIPA-webwerf", "Business registration: add your BIPA registration number and the legal name on your certificate when you register or in Company details. Pesa checks the number looks right and keeps an honest note that you entered it, but it cannot confirm it with BIPA": "Besigheidsregistrasie: voeg jou BIPA-registrasienommer en die wetlike naam op jou sertifikaat by wanneer jy registreer of in Maatskappybesonderhede. Pesa kyk of die nommer reg lyk en hou 'n eerlike nota dat jy dit ingevoer het, maar kan dit nie met BIPA bevestig nie"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Type a name instead": "Tik eerder 'n naam", "Import cost calculator": "Invoerkoste-sakrekenaar", "Work out what imported stock really costs you once freight, clearing fees and customs duty are added. The extra costs are shared across the products by how much you spent on each.": "Bereken wat ingevoerde voorraad jou werklik kos nadat vrag, klaringsfooie en doeanereg bygetel is. Die ekstra koste word tussen die produkte verdeel volgens hoeveel jy op elkeen bestee het.", "Supplier currency": "Verskaffer se geldeenheid", "South African rand (ZAR)": "Suid-Afrikaanse rand (ZAR)", "Namibian dollar (N$)": "Namibiese dollar (N$)", "Another currency": "'n Ander geldeenheid", "N$ for 1 unit of that currency": "N$ vir 1 eenheid van daardie geldeenheid", "Freight": "Vrag", "Clearing fees": "Klaringsfooie", "Customs duty": "Doeanereg", "Mark-up on cost (%)": "Opslag op koste (%)", "Products on the supplier invoice": "Produkte op die verskaffer se faktuur", "Add another product": "Voeg nog 'n produk by", "Supplier price each": "Verskaffer se prys elk", "Add a quantity and the supplier price to see the true cost": "Voeg 'n hoeveelheid en die verskaffer se prys by om die werklike koste te sien", "True cost of each product": "Werklike koste van elke produk", "Supplier price": "Verskaffer se prys", "extra costs": "ekstra koste", "Suggested price": "Voorgestelde prys", "Use as cost price": "Gebruik as kosprys", "each": "elk", "Whole order, landed": "Hele bestelling, aangekom", "Import VAT and any stock already on your shelf are not included. “Use as cost price” replaces the product’s cost price with the figure above.": "Invoer-BTW en voorraad wat reeds op jou rak is, is nie ingesluit nie. “Gebruik as kosprys” vervang die produk se kosprys met die syfer hierbo.", "Cost price updated": "Kosprys opgedateer", "Mobile money check": "Mobielegeld-kontrole", "Pesa cannot read your text messages. Copy the payment messages from your messages app, paste them below, and Pesa lines them up with the wallet sales you recorded. Leave a blank line between messages.": "Pesa kan nie jou teksboodskappe lees nie. Kopieer die betalingsboodskappe uit jou boodskappe-toep, plak dit hieronder, en Pesa pas dit by die beursie-verkope wat jy aangeteken het. Los 'n leë reël tussen boodskappe.", "Day to check": "Dag om na te gaan", "Pasted messages": "Geplakte boodskappe", "Paste the payment messages here": "Plak die betalingsboodskappe hier", "Check": "Gaan na", "No wallet sales on this day and no payment messages pasted": "Geen beursie-verkope op hierdie dag nie en geen betalingsboodskappe geplak nie", "wallet sales matched a message": "beursie-verkope het by 'n boodskap gepas", "message(s) with no sale": "boodskap(pe) sonder verkoop", "Wallet sales": "Beursie-verkope", "No reference recorded": "Geen verwysing aangeteken nie", "Matched by amount only, no reference.": "Slegs op bedrag gepas, geen verwysing.", "Matched by reference.": "Op verwysing gepas.", "Message says": "Boodskap sê", "difference": "verskil", "Messages with no matching sale": "Boodskappe sonder passende verkoop", "pasted message(s) skipped: no amount, or not a payment you received.": "geplakte boodskap(pe) oorgeslaan: geen bedrag, of nie 'n betaling wat jy ontvang het nie.", "Pesa reads the amount and reference from the wording of each message. Wording differs between providers, so always glance at anything marked as not matched.": "Pesa lees die bedrag en verwysing uit die bewoording van elke boodskap. Bewoording verskil tussen verskaffers, so kyk altyd na enigiets wat as nie gepas gemerk is.", "more": "meer", "This is a check, not a block. Confirm tax rules with NamRA if you are unsure.": "Dit is 'n kontrole, nie 'n blokkade nie. Bevestig belastingreëls by NamRA as jy onseker is.", "has no selling price": "het geen verkoopprys nie", "is priced below its cost": "is onder sy kosprys geprys", "is marked tax exempt, but alcohol and tobacco are normally charged VAT at the standard rate": "is as belastingvry gemerk, maar alkohol en tabak dra gewoonlik BTW teen die standaardkoers", "Matched": "Gepas", "Amount differs": "Bedrag verskil", "No message found": "Geen boodskap gevind nie", "True cost of imported stock after freight, clearing and duty": "Werklike koste van ingevoerde voorraad na vrag, klaring en doeanereg", "Match wallet sales with payment messages you paste in": "Pas beursie-verkope by betalingsboodskappe wat jy plak", "Three new business tools: an import cost calculator that shares freight, clearing and duty across your products to show the true cost of each, a mobile money check that lines up payment messages you paste in with your wallet sales, and a quick check at the till for missing prices, selling below cost and wrong tax categories": "Drie nuwe besigheidsgereedskap: 'n invoerkoste-sakrekenaar wat vrag, klaring en doeanereg oor jou produkte verdeel om die werklike koste van elk te wys, 'n mobielegeld-kontrole wat betalingsboodskappe wat jy plak by jou beursie-verkope pas, en 'n vinnige kontrole by die kasregister vir ontbrekende pryse, verkope onder koste en verkeerde belastingkategorieë"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Show more":"Wys meer"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Pesa hit a snag. Your saved records are not affected. If something looks stuck, reload the page.": "Pesa het 'n haakplek getref. Jou gestoorde rekords is nie geraak nie. As iets vassit, laai die bladsy weer.", "Faster searching and scanning: barcodes are found instantly however many products you have, the till product list loads in pages with a Show more button, and a calm message appears instead of a frozen screen if something unexpected goes wrong": "Vinniger soek en skandeer: strepieskodes word dadelik gevind, hoeveel produkte jy ook al het, die kasregister se produklys laai in bladsye met 'n Wys meer-knoppie, en 'n kalm boodskap verskyn in plaas van 'n gevriesde skerm as iets onverwags skeefloop"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Speed check": "Spoedtoets", "Speed check and test products": "Spoedtoets en toetsprodukte", "See how fast Pesa runs here, and load test products to try it": "Kyk hoe vinnig Pesa hier loop, en laai toetsprodukte om dit te probeer", "See how fast Pesa searches, scans barcodes and draws the product list on this computer or device. Nothing is saved or sent anywhere.": "Kyk hoe vinnig Pesa soek, strepieskodes skandeer en die produklys teken op hierdie rekenaar of toestel. Niks word gestoor of êrens heen gestuur nie.", "Test products": "Toetsprodukte", "Load a pile of made-up products to try Pesa yourself: scroll, search, scan a barcode, open the till. They are never saved or synced, they cannot be sold, and they disappear when you reload. Your stock totals and alerts include them while they are loaded.": "Laai 'n hoop uitgedinkte produkte om Pesa self te probeer: blaai, soek, skandeer 'n strepieskode, maak die kasregister oop. Hulle word nooit gestoor of gesinkroniseer nie, kan nie verkoop word nie, en verdwyn wanneer jy herlaai. Jou voorraadtotale en waarskuwings sluit hulle in terwyl hulle gelaai is.", "How many": "Hoeveel", "Load test products": "Laai toetsprodukte", "Remove test products": "Verwyder toetsprodukte", "Run the check": "Voer die toets uit", "Run speed check": "Voer spoedtoets uit", "test products are loaded.": "toetsprodukte is gelaai.", "of your own products.": "van jou eie produkte.", "test products loaded": "toetsprodukte gelaai", "Test products removed": "Toetsprodukte verwyder", "Test products on": "Toetsprodukte aan", "Tap to remove": "Tik om te verwyder", "Your own products": "Jou eie produkte", "Test products you loaded": "Toetsprodukte wat jy gelaai het", "A big shop (30,000 products)": "'n Groot winkel (30 000 produkte)", "No products yet. Load test products above to see how Pesa copes.": "Nog geen produkte nie. Laai toetsprodukte hierbo om te sien hoe Pesa regkom.", "Prepare barcode lookup (once)": "Berei strepieskode-opsoek voor (een keer)", "One barcode scan": "Een strepieskode-skandering", "One search": "Een soektog", "Draw the first page": "Teken die eerste bladsy", "barcodes were not found": "strepieskodes is nie gevind nie", "Times are for this computer or device right now. Fast means you will not notice a delay. Run it again with other apps closed if a result looks slow.": "Tye is vir hierdie rekenaar of toestel nou. Vinnig beteken jy sal geen vertraging agterkom nie. Voer dit weer uit met ander toepassings toe as 'n resultaat stadig lyk.", "Test products cannot be sold. Remove them from the cart first.": "Toetsprodukte kan nie verkoop word nie. Verwyder hulle eers uit die mandjie.", "A speed check shows how fast Pesa runs on your computer or device, and you can load test products to try a very big shop. Test products are never saved, synced or sold": "'n Spoedtoets wys hoe vinnig Pesa op jou rekenaar of toestel loop, en jy kan toetsprodukte laai om 'n baie groot winkel te probeer. Toetsprodukte word nooit gestoor, gesinkroniseer of verkoop nie"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Pesa is a point of sale and business management application built for small and medium shops. It helps an owner and their staff run the daily operations of a shop from a single app on a computer, tablet or other device, whether the shop has one location or several branches.": "Pesa is 'n verkooppunt- en besigheidsbestuurtoepassing vir klein en medium winkels. Dit help 'n eienaar en sy personeel om die daaglikse werk van 'n winkel vanaf een toepassing op 'n rekenaar, tablet of ander toestel te doen, of die winkel een ligging of verskeie takke het.", "Beyond the till, Pesa includes business tools for profit, stock, credit, loyalty, quotes and imports, tax records, and a speed check so you can see how well it runs on your own computer or device.": "Behalwe die kasregister bevat Pesa besigheidsgereedskap vir wins, voorraad, krediet, lojaliteit, kwotasies en invoer, belastingrekords wat gereed is vir NamRA, en 'n spoedtoets sodat jy kan sien hoe goed dit op jou eie rekenaar of toestel loop.", "Support for English, Afrikaans and German, with more of the app translated over time": "Ondersteuning vir Engels, Afrikaans en Duits, met meer van die toepassing wat mettertyd vertaal word", "A staff training section with narrated lessons covering the main parts of the app": "'n Personeelopleidingafdeling met vertelde lesse oor die hoofdele van die toepassing", "Business tools for the owner and managers: end of day summary, profit and targets, staff performance, stock and expiry, who owes me, loyalty rewards, quotes and recurring invoices, barcode labels, importing customers and products, a second currency, and a setup guide": "Besigheidsgereedskap vir die eienaar en bestuurders: dageindopsomming, wins en teikens, personeelprestasie, voorraad en vervaldatums, wie my skuld, lojaliteitsbeloning, kwotasies en herhalende fakture, strepieskode-etikette, invoer van kliënte en produkte, 'n tweede geldeenheid, en 'n opstelgids", "An import cost calculator that shares freight, clearing fees and customs duty across imported products to show the true cost of each, and can save it as the cost price": "'n Invoerkoste-sakrekenaar wat vrag, klaringsfooie en doeanereg oor ingevoerde produkte verdeel om die werklike koste van elk te wys, en dit as die kosprys kan stoor", "A mobile money check that lines up payment messages you paste in with the wallet sales you recorded. Pesa cannot read your messages by itself": "'n Mobielegeld-kontrole wat betalingsboodskappe wat jy plak by die beursie-verkope pas wat jy aangeteken het. Pesa kan nie self jou boodskappe lees nie", "A check at the till that warns about items with no price, items priced below cost, and alcohol or tobacco marked tax exempt. It only warns, it never blocks a sale": "'n Kontrole by die kasregister wat waarsku oor items sonder prys, items onder koste geprys, en alkohol of tabak wat as belastingvry gemerk is. Dit waarsku net, dit blokkeer nooit 'n verkoop nie", "Tax records: the owner can switch on a numbered, tamper evident record of every sale. It works offline and never slows a sale. Electronic invoicing requirements are to be confirmed with the relevant authorities of Namibia, so nothing is sent until connection details exist, and Pesa does not claim NamRA approval": "Belastingrekords gereed vir NamRA: die eienaar kan 'n genommerde, peuterbestande rekord van elke verkoop aanskakel. Dit werk sonder internet en vertraag nooit 'n verkoop nie. NamRA het nog nie sy elektroniese faktureringsreëls gepubliseer nie, so niks word gestuur voordat verbindingsbesonderhede bestaan nie, en Pesa beweer nie NamRA-goedkeuring nie", "Company details with the BIPA registration number, the legal name on the BIPA certificate and the NamRA VAT number. Pesa checks that the BIPA number looks right but cannot confirm it with BIPA, so it records that you entered it yourself": "Maatskappybesonderhede met die BIPA-registrasienommer, die wetlike naam op die BIPA-sertifikaat en die NamRA-BTW-nommer. Pesa kyk of die BIPA-nommer reg lyk maar kan dit nie met BIPA bevestig nie, so dit teken aan dat jy dit self ingevoer het", "Download any document as PDF, Word, Excel, CSV, web page, rich text, plain text or a picture": "Laai enige dokument af as PDF, Word, Excel, CSV, webbladsy, ryke teks, gewone teks of 'n prent", "Sign in protection: strong passwords, limits on guessing, automatic sign out, fingerprint or face approval before records are deleted or restored, and a Security check page for the owner": "Aanmeldbeskerming: sterk wagwoorde, perke op raai, outomatiese afmelding, vingerafdruk- of gesigsgoedkeuring voordat rekords geskrap of herstel word, en 'n Sekuriteitskontrole-bladsy vir die eienaar", "Backups on the device and, on browsers that allow it, in a folder you choose, for example one that syncs to cloud storage": "Rugsteun op die toestel en, op blaaiers wat dit toelaat, in 'n gids wat jy kies, byvoorbeeld een wat met wolkbergingspasie sinkroniseer", "Text size and contrast settings, a setup guide, help search, and a check of how well this computer or device runs Pesa": "Teksgrootte- en kontrasinstellings, 'n opstelgids, hulpsoektog, en 'n kontrole van hoe goed hierdie rekenaar of toestel Pesa laat loop", "A speed check and test products: see how fast Pesa searches, scans and draws the product list on this computer or device, and load made up test products to try a very big shop. Test products are never saved, synced, backed up or sold": "'n Spoedtoets en toetsprodukte: kyk hoe vinnig Pesa soek, skandeer en die produklys teken op hierdie rekenaar of toestel, en laai uitgedinkte toetsprodukte om 'n baie groot winkel te probeer. Toetsprodukte word nooit gestoor, gesinkroniseer, gerugsteun of verkoop nie", "Terms, privacy and support pages that say plainly what Pesa does and does not do": "Bladsye vir bepalings, privaatheid en ondersteuning wat duidelik sê wat Pesa doen en nie doen nie", "A welcome animation when Pesa opens, which you can skip or turn off": "'n Verwelkomingsanimasie wanneer Pesa oopmaak, wat jy kan oorslaan of afskakel", "Licence and subscription: when your Pesa provider switches it on, the owner enters a licence key and Pesa checks the plan on the device": "Lisensie en intekening: wanneer jou Pesa-verskaffer dit aanskakel, voer die eienaar 'n lisensiesleutel in en Pesa kontroleer die plan op die toestel", "Business tools, the import cost calculator, the mobile money check, tax records and the speed check": "Besigheidsgereedskap, die invoerkoste-sakrekenaar, die mobielegeld-kontrole, belastingrekords en die spoedtoets", "Voice search on most computers and devices, because the device’s speech service works online": "Stemsoektog op die meeste rekenaars en toestelle, omdat die toestel se spraakdiens aanlyn werk", "Sending tax records to an authority, once the requirements are confirmed and connection details have been entered. Until then the records stay on the device": "Stuur van belastingrekords na NamRA, sodra verbindingsbesonderhede ingevoer is. Tot dan wag die rekords veilig op die toestel", "Test products live in memory only. They are never saved, so they disappear when you reload": "Toetsprodukte leef net in geheue. Hulle word nooit gestoor nie, so hulle verdwyn wanneer jy herlaai", "It connects your computers, tablets and other devices to one business, so every device shows the same sales, stock, customers and credit": "Dit verbind jou rekenaars, tablette en ander toestelle met een besigheid, sodat elke toestel dieselfde verkope, voorraad, kliënte en krediet wys", "Two devices on the same WiFi connect directly to each other, encrypted, and swap their newest changes. A router with no internet works, and so does one device’s hotspot": "Twee toestelle op dieselfde WiFi koppel direk met mekaar, geënkripteer, en ruil hul nuutste veranderings. 'n Router sonder internet werk, en so ook een toestel se hotspot", "Alerts and checks run only while Pesa is open or was used recently. A browser cannot run a web app in the background the way a device’s own apps can": "Waarskuwings en kontroles loop net terwyl Pesa oop is of onlangs gebruik is. 'n Blaaier kan nie 'n webtoepassing op die agtergrond laat loop soos 'n toestel se eie toepassings nie", "End of day summary: takings, cash, top sellers, profit and a ready message to send": "Dagsluitopsomming: inkomste, kontant, topverkopers, wins en 'n gereed boodskap om te stuur", "Profit and targets: profit for each product, busy times, and daily and monthly goals": "Wins en teikens: wins vir elke produk, besige tye, en daaglikse en maandelikse doelwitte", "Staff performance: sales for each person and bonus goals": "Personeelprestasie: verkope vir elke persoon en bonusdoelwitte", "Stock and expiry: low stock, products close to their expiry date, and orders grouped by supplier": "Voorraad en vervaldatums: lae voorraad, produkte naby hul vervaldatum, en bestellings gegroepeer volgens verskaffer", "Who owes me: customers listed by how long they have owed, with payment reminders": "Wie my skuld: kliënte gelys volgens hoe lank hulle skuld, met betalingsherinneringe", "Loyalty rewards: regular customers earn points that they can use on later sales": "Lojaliteitsbeloning: gereelde kliënte verdien punte wat hulle op latere verkope kan gebruik", "Quotes and recurring invoices: send a quote and turn it into an invoice in one tap, and set up invoices for customers you bill again and again, with a reminder when each is due": "Kwotasies en herhalende fakture: stuur 'n kwotasie en verander dit met een tik in 'n faktuur, en stel fakture op vir kliënte wat jy herhaaldelik faktureer, met 'n herinnering wanneer elkeen verskuldig is", "Barcode labels: print shelf and price labels": "Strepieskode-etikette: druk rak- en pryskaartjies", "Import customers and products from a spreadsheet saved as CSV": "Voer kliënte en produkte in vanaf 'n sigblad wat as CSV gestoor is", "Currency and converter: show a second currency at the till and take cash in it. The Namibian dollar is tied one to one to the South African rand, and you type other rates yourself": "Geldeenheid en omskakelaar: wys 'n tweede geldeenheid by die kasregister en neem kontant daarin aan. Die Namibiese dollar is een tot een aan die Suid-Afrikaanse rand gekoppel, en jy tik ander koerse self in", "Setup guide: a short checklist that takes a new owner through the first steps": "Opstelgids: 'n kort kontrolelys wat 'n nuwe eienaar deur die eerste stappe lei", "Import cost calculator: enter the supplier prices plus freight, clearing fees and customs duty, and Pesa shares the extra costs across the products to show the true cost of each. You can save it as the product cost price. Import VAT is not included": "Invoerkoste-sakrekenaar: voer die verskaffer se pryse plus vrag, klaringsfooie en doeanereg in, en Pesa verdeel die ekstra koste oor die produkte om die werklike koste van elk te wys. Jy kan dit as die produk se kosprys stoor. Invoer-BTW is nie ingesluit nie", "Mobile money check: copy payment messages from your messages app, paste them in, pick a day, and Pesa lines them up with the wallet sales you recorded. It lists sales with no message and messages with no sale. Pesa reads the amount and reference from the wording, so glance at anything marked as not matched": "Mobielegeld-kontrole: kopieer betalingsboodskappe uit jou boodskappe-toep, plak dit in, kies 'n dag, en Pesa pas dit by die beursie-verkope wat jy aangeteken het. Dit lys verkope sonder boodskap en boodskappe sonder verkoop. Pesa lees die bedrag en verwysing uit die bewoording, so kyk na enigiets wat as nie gepas gemerk is", "Speed check and test products: run a check of searching, barcode scanning and drawing the product list, and load from 1,000 to 50,000 made up test products to try a very big shop. Test products are never saved, synced, backed up or sold, and tapping the notice removes them": "Spoedtoets en toetsprodukte: voer 'n toets van soek, strepieskode-skandering en die teken van die produklys uit, en laai van 1 000 tot 50 000 uitgedinkte toetsprodukte om 'n baie groot winkel te probeer. Toetsprodukte word nooit gestoor, gesinkroniseer, gerugsteun of verkoop nie, en as jy op die kennisgewing tik, word hulle verwyder", "Business tools (Owner and Manager, from the menu)": "Besigheidsgereedskap (Eienaar en Bestuurder, vanaf die kieslys)", "Barcodes are found instantly through an index, however many products you have": "Strepieskodes word dadelik deur 'n indeks gevind, hoeveel produkte jy ook al het", "The point of sale product list loads in pages of 120 with a Show more button, and searching waits until you pause typing, so a very large shop does not freeze": "Die verkooppunt se produklys laai in bladsye van 120 met 'n Wys meer-knoppie, en soek wag totdat jy ophou tik, sodat 'n baie groot winkel nie vries nie", "If something unexpected goes wrong, Pesa shows one calm message instead of a frozen screen. Your saved records are not affected": "As iets onverwags skeefloop, wys Pesa een kalm boodskap in plaas van 'n gevriesde skerm. Jou gestoorde rekords word nie geraak nie", "Speeds depend on the computer or device. The Speed check shows the real figures for yours": "Spoed hang af van die rekenaar of toestel. Die Spoedtoets wys die werklike syfers vir joune", "Speed and reliability": "Spoed en betroubaarheid", "Pesa cannot read text messages by itself, so the mobile money check only works on messages you paste in": "Pesa kan nie self teksboodskappe lees nie, so die mobielegeld-kontrole werk net op boodskappe wat jy plak", "A BIPA registration number is saved as entered by you. Pesa cannot confirm it with BIPA, so it never shows a number as verified": "'n BIPA-registrasienommer word gestoor soos jy dit ingevoer het. Pesa kan dit nie met BIPA bevestig nie, so dit wys nooit 'n nommer as bevestig nie", "Tax records are kept on the device. Requirements are to be confirmed with the relevant authorities of Namibia, and nothing is sent anywhere until connection details are entered": "Belastingrekords word gereed gehou vir NamRA, maar Pesa beweer nie dat dit deur NamRA goedgekeur is nie, en niks word gestuur voordat NamRA sy reëls publiseer en jy verbindingsbesonderhede invoer nie", "Pesa records and checks payments but does not move money, and it does not process cards": "Pesa teken betalings aan en kontroleer dit maar skuif nie geld nie, en verwerk nie kaarte nie", "The About page and its PDF now describe everything Pesa can do, including business tools, tax records, the import cost calculator, the mobile money check, the speed check and the limits of each": "Die Aangaande-bladsy en sy PDF beskryf nou alles wat Pesa kan doen, insluitend besigheidsgereedskap, belastingrekords, die invoerkoste-sakrekenaar, die mobielegeld-kontrole, die spoedtoets en die perke van elk"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Meet the developer": "Ontmoet die ontwikkelaar", "Hello and welcome to Pesa! My name is Björn Van Rensburg. I am a 30 year old software developer, born and raised right here in Windhoek, Namibia.": "Hallo en welkom by Pesa! My naam is Björn Van Rensburg. Ek is 'n 30 jaar oue sagtewareontwikkelaar, gebore en getoë hier in Windhoek, Namibië.", "Why I built Pesa": "Hoekom ek Pesa gebou het", "I built Pesa because I watched local Namibian shop owners struggle for years with expensive, over complicated point of sale systems imported from South Africa. Those corporate systems do not understand what it is like when our local internet towers go down, or how vital mobile wallets like PayToday, easyWallet and Blue Wallet are to our daily trade. Pesa was built specifically to solve those unique Namibian realities.": "Ek het Pesa gebou omdat ek jare lank gesien het hoe plaaslike Namibiese winkeleienaars sukkel met duur, te ingewikkelde verkooppuntstelsels wat uit Suid-Afrika ingevoer word. Daardie korporatiewe stelsels verstaan nie hoe dit is wanneer ons plaaslike internettorings afgaan nie, of hoe belangrik mobiele beursies soos PayToday, easyWallet en Blue Wallet vir ons daaglikse handel is nie. Pesa is spesifiek gebou om daardie unieke Namibiese werklikhede op te los.", "Your Mula, Your Pride": "Jou Mula, Jou Trots", "Because the phrase Your Mula, Your Pride is our core promise, this application comes with a strict confidentiality agreement. Here are the three promises that matter most.": "Omdat die frase Jou Mula, Jou Trots ons kernbelofte is, kom hierdie toepassing met 'n streng vertroulikheidsooreenkoms. Hier is die drie belangrikste beloftes.", "You can read the full agreement any time under Menu, Terms, privacy and support, and on the About Pesa page.": "Jy kan die volledige ooreenkoms enige tyd lees onder Kieslys, Bepalings, privaatheid en ondersteuning, en op die Aangaande Pesa-bladsy.", "Promise one: total data sovereignty": "Belofte een: totale data-soewereiniteit", "Your sales, inventory and customer credits belong strictly to your shop. I have zero access to your margins.": "Jou verkope, voorraad en kliëntekrediet behoort streng aan jou winkel. Ek het geen toegang tot jou winsmarges nie.", "Promise two: no central server trackers": "Belofte twee: geen sentrale bediener-snuffelaars", "Pesa saves your data to your own computer or device first. If you turn on cloud syncing, it connects only to a private online database that you control through Supabase.": "Pesa stoor jou data eers op jou eie rekenaar of toestel. As jy wolksinkronisering aanskakel, koppel dit net aan 'n private aanlyn databasis wat jy deur Supabase beheer.", "Promise three: no hidden backdoors": "Belofte drie: geen versteekte agterdeure", "The application does not send usage tracking, background analytics or financial reports back to me.": "Die toepassing stuur nie gebruiksopsporing, agtergrondontleding of finansiële verslae terug aan my nie.", "To be fully open: the first time Pesa is opened online it fetches its fonts and its PDF tool from public servers, a password reset email is sent only if the owner sets that up, and tax records go to NamRA only if you enter its details. None of these carry your business records to me.": "Om heeltemal oop te wees: die eerste keer wat Pesa aanlyn oopgemaak word, haal dit sy lettertipes en sy PDF-hulpmiddel van openbare bedieners af, 'n wagwoordterugstel-e-pos word net gestuur as die eienaar dit opstel, en belastingrekords gaan net na NamRA as jy sy besonderhede invoer. Geeneen hiervan dra jou besigheidsrekords na my nie.", "Thank you, and how to reach me": "Dankie, en hoe om my te bereik", "Thank you for choosing local innovation to drive Namibia's retail growth. If you ever have technical feedback or questions during your store operations, you can reach me directly on WhatsApp at 081 821 1692, or by email at ecrypted5@gmail.com.": "Dankie dat jy plaaslike innovasie kies om Namibië se kleinhandelgroei aan te dryf. As jy ooit tegniese terugvoer of vrae het tydens jou winkelbedrywighede, kan jy my regstreeks bereik op WhatsApp by 081 821 1692, of per e-pos by ecrypted5@gmail.com.", "Meet the developer and your privacy promise": "Ontmoet die ontwikkelaar en jou privaatheidsbelofte", "Menu → About Pesa": "Kieslys → Aangaande Pesa", "Menu → Terms, privacy and support": "Kieslys → Bepalings, privaatheid en ondersteuning", "Menu → About Pesa → Your privacy and confidentiality": "Kieslys → Aangaande Pesa → Jou privaatheid en vertroulikheid", "Settings → Advanced Pesa Connection settings": "Instellings → Gevorderde Pesa-verbindingsinstellings", "Menu → About Pesa → Contact the developer": "Kieslys → Aangaande Pesa → Kontak die ontwikkelaar", "A new first training lesson, Meet the developer and your privacy promise, with a narrated message from the developer about why Pesa was built and what it never does with your records": "'n Nuwe eerste opleidingsles, Ontmoet die ontwikkelaar en jou privaatheidsbelofte, met 'n vertelde boodskap van die ontwikkelaar oor hoekom Pesa gebou is en wat dit nooit met jou rekords doen nie"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Pilot feedback form": "Loodsproef-terugvoervorm", "A 48 hour pilot run. Please fill this in by hand while you work. Be honest: every problem you write down helps make Pesa better. Do not write passwords, PINs or customers’ personal details on this form.": "'n 48 uur loodsproef. Vul dit asseblief met die hand in terwyl jy werk. Wees eerlik: elke probleem wat jy neerskryf help om Pesa beter te maak. Moenie wagwoorde, PIN's of kliënte se persoonlike besonderhede op hierdie vorm skryf nie.", "About you and the pilot": "Oor jou en die loodsproef", "Cashier name": "Kassier se naam", "Shop or branch": "Winkel of tak", "Device used (computer, tablet or other)": "Toestel gebruik (rekenaar, tablet of ander)", "Shifts I worked": "Skofte wat ek gewerk het", "Pilot started (date and time)": "Loodsproef begin (datum en tyd)", "Pilot ended (date and time)": "Loodsproef geëindig (datum en tyd)", "How easy was it? Circle one number for each line": "Hoe maklik was dit? Omkring een nommer vir elke reël", "1 = very hard    3 = fine    5 = very easy": "1 = baie moeilik    3 = reg    5 = baie maklik", "Making a sale at the till": "'n Verkoop by die kasregister maak", "Finding a product by name or barcode": "'n Produk volgens naam of strepieskode vind", "Taking cash, card or wallet payments": "Kontant-, kaart- of beursiebetalings aanvaar", "Printing or sharing receipts": "Kwitansies druk of deel", "Opening and closing my till": "My kasregister oop- en toemaak", "Working when the internet was down": "Werk wanneer die internet af was", "Speed of the app overall": "Spoed van die toepassing in die algemeen", "Overall, how easy was Pesa to use?": "Oor die algemeen, hoe maklik was Pesa om te gebruik?", "Numbers for my shift or shifts": "Syfers vir my skof of skofte", "About how many sales did I make?": "Ongeveer hoeveel verkope het ek gemaak?", "Times Pesa was slow or froze": "Kere wat Pesa stadig was of gevries het", "Times the internet was down": "Kere wat die internet af was", "Times a barcode would not scan": "Kere wat 'n strepieskode nie wou skandeer nie", "Times I needed help from someone": "Kere wat ek hulp van iemand nodig gehad het", "Sales I had to correct or cancel": "Verkope wat ek moes regstel of kanselleer", "Working without internet (tick one box for each question)": "Werk sonder internet (merk een blokkie vir elke vraag)", "Did Pesa keep working when the internet was down?": "Het Pesa aanhou werk toe die internet af was?", "Did my sales show up on the other devices afterwards?": "Het my verkope daarna op die ander toestelle verskyn?", "Partly": "Gedeeltelik", "It did not happen": "Dit het nie gebeur nie", "Not tried": "Nie probeer nie", "Not sure": "Nie seker nie", "Not yet": "Nog nie", "Problem log: write down anything that went wrong": "Probleemlogboek: skryf alles neer wat skeefgeloop het", "What I was doing": "Wat ek gedoen het", "What went wrong": "Wat verkeerd geloop het", "How bad?": "Hoe erg?", "How bad: S = small, A = annoying, X = stopped the sale. Circle one letter.": "Hoe erg: S = klein, A = irriterend, X = het die verkoop gestop. Omkring een letter.", "In my own words": "In my eie woorde", "What worked best for me?": "Wat het vir my die beste gewerk?", "What was most confusing or slow?": "Wat was die verwarrendste of stadigste?", "What did customers say or do?": "Wat het kliënte gesê of gedoen?", "What is the first thing I would change?": "Wat is die eerste ding wat ek sou verander?", "My verdict (tick one box for each question)": "My oordeel (merk een blokkie vir elke vraag)", "Would I use Pesa every day?": "Sal ek Pesa elke dag gebruik?", "Would I trust Pesa to run my till on its own?": "Sal ek Pesa vertrou om my kasregister alleen te laat loop?", "Signatures": "Handtekeninge", "Cashier signature": "Kassier se handtekening", "Reviewed by owner or manager": "Nagegaan deur eienaar of bestuurder", "Owner or manager notes": "Notas van eienaar of bestuurder", "Print it and note how Pesa works for you during the 48 hour pilot.": "Druk dit en skryf neer hoe Pesa vir jou werk tydens die 48 uur loodsproef.", "Print this form and fill it in by hand while you work during the 48 hour pilot run. Hand it to the owner when the pilot ends.": "Druk hierdie vorm en vul dit met die hand in terwyl jy werk tydens die 48 uur loodsproef. Gee dit aan die eienaar wanneer die loodsproef eindig.", "What is on the form": "Wat op die vorm is", "Name, shop, device and when the pilot started": "Naam, winkel, toestel en wanneer die loodsproef begin het", "How easy was it?": "Hoe maklik was dit?", "Eight lines to rate from 1 to 5": "Agt reëls om van 1 tot 5 te gradeer", "Sales made, slow moments, internet down, scans that failed": "Verkope gemaak, stadige oomblikke, internet af, skanderings wat misluk het", "Working without internet": "Werk sonder internet", "Did it keep working, and did the sales show up later": "Het dit aanhou werk, en het die verkope later verskyn", "Problem log": "Probleemlogboek", "Eight lines for date, what happened and how bad": "Agt reëls vir datum, wat gebeur het en hoe erg", "What worked, what confused, what customers said, what to change": "Wat gewerk het, wat verwar het, wat kliënte gesê het, wat om te verander", "My verdict": "My oordeel", "Would I use it every day, and trust it on its own": "Sal ek dit elke dag gebruik, en dit alleen vertrou", "Cashier and owner or manager": "Kassier en eienaar of bestuurder", "Fill in my name and the shop": "Vul my naam en die winkel in", "Pilot starts": "Loodsproef begin", "If you enter it, the form also prints when the 48 hours end.": "As jy dit invoer, druk die vorm ook wanneer die 48 uur eindig.", "Download or print the form": "Laai die vorm af of druk dit", "Open the downloaded file and print it. Choose Word if you want to change the wording first.": "Maak die afgelaaide lêer oop en druk dit. Kies Word as jy eers die bewoording wil verander.", "Show the Pilot feedback form card on employee dashboards": "Wys die Loodsproef-terugvoervorm-kaart op werknemers se paneelborde", "Form downloaded": "Vorm afgelaai", "Couldn’t make the form. Please try again.": "Kon nie die vorm maak nie. Probeer asseblief weer.", "Hand this form to the shop owner when the pilot ends. If a problem needs the developer, contact him on WhatsApp 081 821 1692 or by email at ecrypted5@gmail.com.": "Gee hierdie vorm aan die winkeleienaar wanneer die loodsproef eindig. As 'n probleem die ontwikkelaar nodig het, kontak hom op WhatsApp 081 821 1692 of per e-pos by ecrypted5@gmail.com.", "A printable pilot feedback form for cashiers, on the employee dashboard and in the menu, with ratings, a problem log and space for their own words": "'n Drukbare loodsproef-terugvoervorm vir kassiers, op die werknemerpaneelbord en in die kieslys, met graderings, 'n probleemlogboek en spasie vir hul eie woorde", "A printable Pilot feedback form for cashiers to log how Pesa works for them during the 48 hour pilot run. Find it on the employee dashboard and in the menu": "'n Drukbare Loodsproef-terugvoervorm vir kassiers om aan te teken hoe Pesa vir hulle werk tydens die 48 uur loodsproef. Kry dit op die werknemerpaneelbord en in die kieslys"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Invoice": "Faktuur", "Tax invoice": "Belastingfaktuur", "VAT registration no.": "BTW-registrasienr.", "Net total excl. VAT": "Netto totaal sonder BTW", "VAT {0}": "BTW {0}", "Gross total due": "Bruto verskuldig", "Document verification signature": "Dokumentverifikasie-handtekening", "Reserved for a verification code. Requirements are to be confirmed with the relevant authorities of Namibia.": "Gereserveer vir 'n kriptografiese verifikasiekode. Totdat 'n kode in die blokkie hieronder gedruk is, is hierdie dokument nie deur NamRA gevalideer nie.", "Verification code": "Verifikasiekode", "Customer TIN (optional, for business customers)": "Kliënt se TIN (opsioneel, vir sakekliënte)", "Your TIN is not set, so it will not print on this tax invoice. Add it in Settings, Tax records.": "Jou TIN is nie gestel nie, dus sal dit nie op hierdie belastingfaktuur druk nie. Voeg dit by in Instellings, Belastingrekords.", "Dairy products": "Suiwelprodukte", "Bakery": "Bakkery", "Cold drinks and water": "Koeldrank en water", "Meat and fish": "Vleis en vis", "Fruit and vegetables": "Vrugte en groente", "Dry goods and groceries": "Droogware en kruideniersware", "Household and cleaning": "Huishoudelik en skoonmaak", "Toiletries and health": "Toiletware en gesondheid", "Snacks and sweets": "Peuselhappies en lekkers", "Other products": "Ander produkte", "Tax invoices show your TIN and VAT registration number, the buyer's TIN, and a net, VAT, zero rated, exempt and gross breakdown. Stock is listed under department headers, and you can tick several products at a time on invoices, quotes and purchase orders": "Belastingfakture wys jou TIN en BTW registrasienommer, die koper se TIN, en 'n uiteensetting in netto, BTW, nulkoers, vrygestel en bruto. Voorraad word onder departementopskrifte gelys, en jy kan verskeie produkte op een slag op fakture, kwotasies en aankooporders merk"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Answers tapped in on screen in Pesa.": "Antwoorde op die skerm in Pesa gekies.", "Small": "Klein", "Annoying": "Irriterend", "Stopped the sale": "Het die verkoop gestop", "Computer": "Rekenaar", "Tablet": "Tablet", "Other device": "Ander toestel", "No problems logged": "Geen probleme aangeteken nie", "Submitted in Pesa on": "In Pesa ingedien op", "Your name": "Jou naam", "e.g. Monday morning, Tuesday full day": "bv. Maandagoggend, Dinsdag heeldag", "Tap your answers. They save on this device as you go, so you can stop and come back. Do not write passwords, PINs or customers’ personal details.": "Tik jou antwoorde. Hulle word op hierdie toestel gestoor soos jy gaan, so jy kan ophou en terugkom. Moenie wagwoorde, PIN's of kliënte se persoonlike besonderhede skryf nie.", "Add a problem": "Voeg 'n probleem by", "Add this problem": "Voeg hierdie probleem by", "Remove": "Verwyder", "Write what went wrong first": "Skryf eers wat verkeerd geloop het", "Save and submit": "Stoor en dien in", "Save and finish later": "Stoor en voltooi later", "Draft saved": "Konsep gestoor", "Answer at least one question first": "Beantwoord eers ten minste een vraag", "Pilot feedback saved": "Loodsproef-terugvoer gestoor", "Your form is saved on this device. Pesa cannot send it by itself, so tap a button to send a copy to the developer. Nothing leaves this device until you tap.": "Jou vorm is op hierdie toestel gestoor. Pesa kan dit nie self stuur nie, so tik 'n knoppie om 'n kopie aan die ontwikkelaar te stuur. Niks verlaat hierdie toestel voordat jy tik nie.", "WhatsApp the developer": "WhatsApp die ontwikkelaar", "Email the developer": "E-pos die ontwikkelaar", "Share or copy the answers": "Deel of kopieer die antwoorde", "Download a PDF copy": "Laai 'n PDF-kopie af", "WhatsApp opened": "WhatsApp oopgemaak", "Email opened": "E-pos oopgemaak", "Shared or copied": "Gedeel of gekopieer", "PDF copy saved": "PDF-kopie gestoor", "Copied": "Gekopieer", "Couldn’t copy. Use the WhatsApp or email button instead.": "Kon nie kopieer nie. Gebruik eerder die WhatsApp- of e-poskнoppie.", "Pilot feedback submitted. Thank you!": "Loodsproef-terugvoer ingedien. Dankie!", "Tap to send a copy to the developer again, or to fill in a new form.": "Tik om weer 'n kopie aan die ontwikkelaar te stuur, of om 'n nuwe vorm in te vul.", "You have a saved draft. Tap to finish it.": "Jy het 'n gestoorde konsep. Tik om dit te voltooi.", "Tap here to answer it on screen. It takes about 5 minutes.": "Tik hier om dit op die skerm te beantwoord. Dit neem ongeveer 5 minute.", "Please fill in the pilot feedback form": "Vul asseblief die loodsproef-terugvoervorm in", "The 48 hours are over. Please send your form today.": "Die 48 uur is verby. Stuur asseblief vandag jou vorm.", "The pilot ends in": "Die loodsproef eindig oor", "hour": "uur", "hours": "uur", "Fill in the form here on screen by tapping your answers. When you submit, you can send a copy to the developer with one tap.": "Vul die vorm hier op die skerm in deur jou antwoorde te tik. Wanneer jy indien, kan jy met een tik 'n kopie aan die ontwikkelaar stuur.", "Continue my form": "Gaan voort met my vorm", "Fill in a new form": "Vul 'n nuwe vorm in", "Fill in the form on screen": "Vul die vorm op die skerm in", "Forms I filled in on this device": "Vorms wat ek op hierdie toestel ingevul het", "Send options used": "Stuuropsies gebruik", "Not sent yet. Tap to send.": "Nog nie gestuur nie. Tik om te stuur.", "Paper copy": "Papierkopie", "Download or print a blank paper form": "Laai 'n leë papiervorm af of druk dit", "For the owner or manager": "Vir die eienaar of bestuurder", "The 48 hour pilot started": "Die 48 uur loodsproef het begin", "No pilot start time is set. Start it so everyone sees how long is left.": "Geen begintyd vir die loodsproef is gestel nie. Begin dit sodat almal sien hoe lank oor is.", "Start the 48 hours now": "Begin die 48 uur nou", "Clear the start time": "Vee die begintyd uit", "Show the pilot reminder and form card to everyone": "Wys die loodsproef-herinnering en vormkaart aan almal", "Reminder: please fill in the pilot feedback form.": "Herinnering: vul asseblief die loodsproef-terugvoervorm in.", "Fill in": "Vul in", "Pilot feedback reminder": "Loodsproef-terugvoerherinnering", "Please take a few minutes to fill in the pilot feedback form. It helps make Pesa better for your shop.": "Neem asseblief 'n paar minute om die loodsproef-terugvoervorm in te vul. Dit help om Pesa beter vir jou winkel te maak.", "Fill in now": "Vul nou in", "Remind me later": "Herinner my later", "The pilot feedback form can be filled in on screen by tapping answers. A copy can be sent to the developer with one tap, and Pesa reminds everyone until it is done": "Die loodsproef-terugvoervorm kan op die skerm ingevul word deur antwoorde te tik. 'n Kopie kan met een tik aan die ontwikkelaar gestuur word, en Pesa herinner almal totdat dit klaar is"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Accountant": "Rekenmeester", "Accountant is for owners and managers": "Rekenmeester is vir eienaars en bestuurders", "Run report now": "Laat loop verslag nou", "File missing months": "Lêer ontbrekende maande", "Opening balances": "Openingssaldo's", "Books start": "Boeke begin", "First record in Pesa": "Eerste rekord in Pesa", "Latest month filed": "Jongste maand gelêer", "None yet": "Nog geen", "Checks": "Kontroles", "Monthly accounting packs": "Maandelikse rekeningkundige pakkette", "VAT return working figures": "BTW opgawe werksyfers", "Filed": "Gelêer", "Verified": "Geverifieer", "Records changed since filing": "Rekords verander sedert lêering", "Hash does not match": "Hash stem nie ooreen nie", "Journal": "Joernaal", "Trial balance": "Proefbalans", "Re-run month": "Laat maand weer loop", "Prepared": "Voorberei", "Prepared by": "Voorberei deur", "Record hash": "Rekord hash", "This pack": "Hierdie pakket", "Previous month": "Vorige maand", "Earlier revisions": "Vroeër hersienings", "automatic": "outomaties", "Accounting pack": "Rekeningkundige pakket", "Monthly accounting pack": "Maandelikse rekeningkundige pakket", "Accounting pack downloaded": "Rekeningkundige pakket afgelaai", "VAT working figures": "BTW werksyfers", "VAT working figures downloaded": "BTW werksyfers afgelaai", "Your VAT category": "Jou BTW kategorie", "Return due by": "Opgawe verskuldig teen", "Period not finished": "Tydperk nog nie klaar nie", "Income statement": "Inkomstestaat", "Statement of financial position": "Staat van finansiële posisie", "Ledger summary by day": "Grootboekopsomming per dag", "Basis of preparation": "Grondslag van voorbereiding", "Checks on these figures": "Kontroles op hierdie syfers", "Passed": "Geslaag", "FAILED": "GEFAAL", "Review": "Hersien", "Sales (excluding VAT)": "Verkope (sonder BTW)", "Cost of goods sold and wastage": "Koste van verkope en vermorsing", "Total sales (excluding VAT)": "Totale verkope (sonder BTW)", "Stock wastage and shrinkage": "Voorraadvermorsing en krimping", "Total operating expenses": "Totale bedryfsuitgawes", "Net profit for the period": "Netto wins vir die tydperk", "Net loss for the period": "Netto verlies vir die tydperk", "Output VAT (charged on sales)": "Uitset BTW (op verkope ghef)", "Input VAT (on supplier tax invoices recorded)": "Inset BTW (op aangetekende verskaffer belastingfakture)", "Net VAT payable to NamRA": "Netto BTW betaalbaar aan NamRA", "Net VAT refundable from NamRA": "Netto BTW terugbetaalbaar deur NamRA", "Standard rated supplies, excluding VAT": "Standaardkoers lewerings, sonder BTW", "Standard rated supplies, including VAT": "Standaardkoers lewerings, met BTW", "Zero rated supplies": "Nulkoers lewerings", "Exempt supplies": "Vrygestelde lewerings", "Total supplies, including VAT": "Totale lewerings, met BTW", "Total assets": "Totale bates", "Total liabilities": "Totale laste", "Total equity": "Totale ekwiteit", "Total liabilities and equity": "Totale laste en ekwiteit", "Prepared by Pesa from the sales, expenses, supplier invoices and payments, wastage and customer payments recorded in it, on an accrual basis, in Namibia Dollars (N$) to the cent. Cost of goods sold uses the cost price held on each product when it was sold. Stock, receivables and payables are the movements recorded in Pesa plus the opening balances entered.": "Deur Pesa voorberei uit die verkope, uitgawes, verskaffersfakture en betalings, vermorsing en kliëntbetalings wat daarin aangeteken is, op 'n toevallingsgrondslag, in Namibiese Dollar (N$) tot op die sent. Koste van verkope gebruik die kosprys op elke produk toe dit verkoop is. Voorraad, debiteure en krediteure is die bewegings in Pesa plus die openingssaldo's wat ingevoer is.", "Pesa does not see your bank, fixed assets, loans, payroll taxes, owner drawings, income tax or imports, so those are not in these figures. A registered accountant should review them before they are used for annual financial statements, tax returns or a loan application.": "Pesa sien nie jou bank, vaste bates, lenings, betaalstaatbelasting, eienaarsopnames, inkomstebelasting of invoere nie, so dit is nie in hierdie syfers nie. 'n Geregistreerde rekenmeester moet dit hersien voordat dit vir jaarlikse finansiële state, belastingopgawes of 'n leningsaansoek gebruik word.", "These documents are prepared by software. They are not audited or reviewed, and they are to be confirmed with the relevant legal bodies, authorities and entities of Namibia and your accountant. Namibian tax law requires business records and supporting documents to be kept for at least five years, so keep this pack with your sales records, supplier tax invoices and bank statements.": "Hierdie dokumente is deur sagteware voorberei. Dit is nie geouditeer of nagegaan nie, en dit is nie deur NamRA of enige rekenmeester goedgekeur of gesertifiseer nie. Namibiese belastingwetgewing vereis dat sakerekords en stawende dokumente vir ten minste vyf jaar gehou word, so hou hierdie pakket saam met jou verkoperekords, verskaffer belastingfakture en bankstate.", "Not VAT registered": "Nie BTW geregistreer nie", "Choose": "Kies", "Opening": "Opening", "Debits": "Debiete", "Credits": "Krediete", "Closing": "Sluiting", "Lines": "Lyne", "Result": "Resultaat", "VAT on the supplier tax invoice (N$, optional)": "BTW op die verskaffer belastingfaktuur (N$, opsioneel)", "VAT on this tax invoice (N$, optional)": "BTW op hierdie belastingfaktuur (N$, opsioneel)", "Only enter VAT you hold a valid tax invoice for. It is counted as input VAT in the Accountant.": "Voer net BTW in waarvoor jy 'n geldige belastingfaktuur het. Dit word as inset BTW in die Rekenmeester getel.", "monthly accounting pack filed in Accountant": "maandelikse rekeningkundige pakket in Rekenmeester gelêer", "monthly accounting packs filed in Accountant": "maandelikse rekeningkundige pakkette in Rekenmeester gelêer", "Monthly accounting packs, VAT working figures, trial balance": "Maandelikse rekeningkundige pakkette, BTW werksyfers, proefbalans", "Books start on": "Boeke begin op", "Cash on hand": "Kontant byderhand", "Digital wallets": "Digitale beursies", "Bank balance": "Banksaldo", "Stock at cost": "Voorraad teen koste", "Owed to suppliers": "Aan verskaffers verskuldig", "New revision filed": "Nuwe hersiening gelêer", "Opening balances saved": "Openingssaldo's gestoor", "Opening balances cleared": "Openingssaldo's uitgevee", "This month so far": "Hierdie maand tot dusver", "Last month": "Verlede maand", "Run for these dates": "Laat loop vir hierdie datums", "Journal for these dates": "Joernaal vir hierdie datums", "No months filed yet": "Nog geen maande gelêer nie", "Preparing documents…": "Berei dokumente voor…", "Accountant: double entry books built to the cent from your sales, expenses, supplier invoices and payments, wastage and customer payments. Each finished month is filed automatically the first time the owner or a manager opens Pesa after month end, with a trial balance, income statement, VAT working figures and a hash that shows if a filed month was changed. Documents can also be run on demand. Pesa does not see your bank, and the documents are not approved by NamRA or an accountant": "Rekenmeester: dubbelinskrywing boeke, tot op die sent gebou uit jou verkope, uitgawes, verskaffersfakture en betalings, vermorsing en kliëntbetalings. Elke voltooide maand word outomaties gelêer die eerste keer dat die eienaar of 'n bestuurder Pesa oopmaak ná maandeinde, met 'n proefbalans, inkomstestaat, BTW werksyfers en 'n hash wat wys of 'n gelêerde maand verander is. Dokumente kan ook op aanvraag opgestel word. Pesa sien nie jou bank nie, en die dokumente is nie deur NamRA of 'n rekenmeester goedgekeur nie"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Photo": "Foto", "Voice message": "Stemboodskap", "Voice note": "Stemnota", "Camera": "Kamera", "Attach": "Heg aan", "Call": "Bel", "Call on this device": "Bel op hierdie toestel", "Open WhatsApp chat": "Maak WhatsApp-klets oop", "Pesa opens the dialer on this device. The call is made by your phone network, not inside Pesa.": "Pesa maak die skakelaar op hierdie toestel oop. Die oproep word deur jou foonnetwerk gemaak, nie binne Pesa nie.", "No phone number saved for": "Geen foonnommer gestoor vir", "this person": "hierdie persoon", "Add it in the profile first.": "Voeg dit eers by die profiel by.", "Play voice message": "Speel stemboodskap", "Could not play this voice note.": "Kon nie hierdie stemnota speel nie.", "Save photo": "Stoor foto", "Recording": "Neem op", "Stop the recording first": "Stop eers die opname", "Choose a photo.": "Kies 'n foto.", "Could not read that photo.": "Kon nie daardie foto lees nie.", "That voice note is too long to send. Keep it under 2 minutes.": "Daardie stemnota is te lank om te stuur. Hou dit onder 2 minute.", "Add a caption": "Voeg 'n onderskrif by", "Read": "Gelees", "Messages work like a chat, on a Pesa wallpaper. Send photos, record voice notes of up to two minutes, add emojis, and see ticks that turn gold when a message is read. The call button opens the dialer on this computer or device, or a WhatsApp chat. Pesa does not place calls itself. Messages are saved on the device first, so you can write and send while offline and they go out when the connection returns, as long as Advanced Pesa Connection is on. Photos are shrunk and voice notes are limited so they can be stored and synced with your shop data": "Boodskappe werk soos 'n klets, op 'n Pesa agtergrond. Stuur foto's, neem stemnotas tot twee minute op, voeg emoji's by, en sien regmerkies wat goud word as 'n boodskap gelees is. Die belknoppie maak die skakelaar op hierdie rekenaar of toestel oop, of 'n WhatsApp klets. Pesa maak self nie oproepe nie. Boodskappe word eers op die toestel gestoor, so jy kan vanlyn skryf en stuur en dit gaan uit wanneer die verbinding terugkeer, solank Gevorderde Pesa Verbinding aan is. Foto's word kleiner gemaak en stemnotas is beperk sodat dit saam met jou winkeldata gestoor en gesinkroniseer kan word"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Waiting to send": "Wag om te stuur", "You are offline. Messages are saved on this device and will send when you are back online.": "Jy is vanlyn. Boodskappe word op hierdie toestel gestoor en sal gestuur word wanneer jy weer aanlyn is.", "Advanced Pesa Connection is off, so messages stay on this device. Turn it on in Settings so other devices receive them.": "Gevorderde Pesa Verbinding is af, so boodskappe bly op hierdie toestel. Skakel dit aan in Instellings sodat ander toestelle dit ontvang."}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Narrator voice": "Verteller stem", "Default": "Verstek", "Male": "Manlik", "On this device": "Op hierdie toestel", "Hear": "Luister", "Male American English voices": "Manlike Amerikaanse Engelse stemme", "No male American English voice is installed on this computer or device. Add one in the device settings under speech or text to speech voices, then reopen this page.": "Geen manlike Amerikaanse Engelse stem is op hierdie rekenaar of toestel geïnstalleer nie. Voeg een by in die toestelinstellings onder spraak of teks na spraak stemme, en maak dan hierdie bladsy weer oop.", "Other English male voices": "Ander manlike Engelse stemme", "Deeper tone, where the device allows it": "Dieper toon, waar die toestel dit toelaat", "The voices come from your computer or device, so the list can differ from one device to the next. Recordings you made under My voice still play instead of these voices.": "Die stemme kom van jou rekenaar of toestel, so die lys kan van een toestel tot die volgende verskil. Opnames wat jy onder My stem gemaak het, speel steeds in plaas van hierdie stemme.", "Training lessons are read aloud, and you can choose a male American English voice from the voices installed on your computer or device, hear a sample first, and make the tone deeper where the device allows it. Pesa does not add new voices itself, so the choice depends on what your device has": "Opleidingslesse word hardop voorgelees, en jy kan 'n manlike Amerikaanse Engelse stem kies uit die stemme wat op jou rekenaar of toestel geïnstalleer is, eers 'n voorbeeld hoor, en die toon dieper maak waar die toestel dit toelaat. Pesa voeg self nie nuwe stemme by nie, so die keuse hang af van wat jou toestel het"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Pack": "Pakket", "Journal downloaded": "Joernaal afgelaai", "Trial balance downloaded": "Proefbalans afgelaai", "This document is too long for a picture. Choose PDF, Excel or another format.": "Hierdie dokument is te lank vir 'n prent. Kies PDF, Excel of 'n ander formaat.", "Accounting journal": "Rekeningkundige joernaal", "Journal / line": "Joernaal / reël", "Entries": "Inskrywings", "Interim, not filed": "Tussentydse, nie ingedien nie", "Matches the filed copy": "Stem ooreen met die ingediende kopie", "Records changed since the pack was filed": "Rekords het verander sedert die pakket ingedien is", "Amounts are in NAD. Each line is one side of a journal: debits equal credits in every journal.": "Bedrae is in NAD. Elke reël is een kant van 'n joernaal: debiete is gelyk aan krediete in elke joernaal.", "Every Accountant document, including the journal and the trial balance, downloads as PDF, Word, Excel, CSV, web page, rich text, plain text or a picture. The Excel and CSV files keep every column, so your accountant can sort and check them": "Elke Rekenmeester dokument, insluitend die joernaal en die proefbalans, laai af as PDF, Word, Excel, CSV, webblad, ryke teks, gewone teks of 'n prent. Die Excel en CSV lêers behou elke kolom, sodat jou rekenmeester dit kan sorteer en nagaan"}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"What the word Pesa means": "Wat die woord Pesa beteken", "Pesa is a Swahili word for money, used across East Africa and beyond. I chose it because money is what every shop lives on: what comes in, what goes out, and what is left at the end of the day. The whole app is built around that. Every sale, expense, credit account and cash up is a story about money, and Pesa keeps those stories clear and in order. It also sits beside our promise, Your Mula, Your Pride: it is your money, and the pride is in running your own shop well.": "Pesa is 'n Swahili woord vir geld, wat regdeur Oos Afrika en verder gebruik word. Ek het dit gekies omdat geld is waarop elke winkel leef: wat inkom, wat uitgaan, en wat aan die einde van die dag oorbly. Die hele toep is daarom gebou. Elke verkoping, uitgawe, kredietrekening en kasopmaak is 'n storie oor geld, en Pesa hou daardie stories duidelik en in orde. Dit staan ook langs ons belofte, Your Mula, Your Pride: dit is jou geld, en die trots lê daarin om jou eie winkel goed te bestuur.", "Mula is the street word for money in Namibia, so the name and the promise say the same thing in two voices.": "Mula is die straatwoord vir geld in Namibië, so die naam en die belofte sê dieselfde ding in twee stemme."}); });
__LL.af.push(function(LANGS){ Object.assign(LANGS.af.strings, {"Keyboard shortcuts at the till: press / or F2 to jump to product search, and F9 or Ctrl and Enter to open the cart and charge. Buttons give a small press response when tapped, unless the simpler look or reduced motion is on":"Sleutelbordkortpaaie by die kassa: druk / of F2 om na produksoek te spring, en F9 of Ctrl en Enter om die mandjie oop te maak en te betaal. Knoppies gee ’n klein drukreaksie wanneer jy hulle tik, tensy die eenvoudiger voorkoms of verminderde beweging aan is","Seeing the Inter font from the web on a device that has never loaded it online. The PDF engine and the Pesa fonts come with the app, so PDFs and documents work offline":"Die Inter lettertipe van die web sien op ’n toestel wat dit nog nooit aanlyn gelaai het nie. Die PDF enjin en die Pesa lettertipes kom saam met die toep, so PDF’s en dokumente werk sonder internet","The Accountant page shows profit or loss for any dates in a clear layout and makes a Profit and Loss report to keep, with a report number and fingerprints. Pesa lists the reports you make so you can check one later, can check all kept months and the chain between them, and can save a copy of the records and check that copy. Reports are prepared by software, are not audited, and are to be confirmed with your accountant":"Die Rekenmeester bladsy wys wins of verlies vir enige datums in ’n duidelike uitleg en maak ’n Wins en Verlies verslag om te hou, met ’n verslagnommer en vingerafdrukke. Pesa lys die verslae wat jy maak sodat jy een later kan nagaan, kan alle gehoue maande en die ketting tussen hulle nagaan, en kan ’n kopie van die rekords stoor en daardie kopie nagaan. Verslae word deur sagteware voorberei, is nie geouditeer nie, en moet met jou rekenmeester bevestig word","Profit or loss":"Wins of verlies","Make a report to keep":"Maak ’n verslag om te hou","More documents":"Meer dokumente","Reports you made":"Verslae wat jy gemaak het","Keep your records safe":"Hou jou rekords veilig","Save the report":"Stoor die verslag","Print the report":"Druk die verslag","Check a report":"Gaan ’n verslag na","Check":"Gaan na","Check all records now":"Gaan alle rekords nou na","Save a copy of all records":"Stoor ’n kopie van alle rekords","Check a saved copy":"Gaan ’n gestoorde kopie na","This month":"Hierdie maand","Last month":"Verlede maand","This quarter":"Hierdie kwartaal","This year":"Hierdie jaar","Pick dates":"Kies datums","Profit":"Wins","Loss":"Verlies","Break even":"Nul wins of verlies","Money coming in":"Geld wat inkom","Money going out":"Geld wat uitgaan","Gross profit":"Bruto wins","Running costs":"Lopende koste","Total running costs":"Totale lopende koste","Profit and Loss report":"Wins en Verlies verslag","Report no":"Verslagnommer"}); });
